  "notes": "Flatt: only 'FLATT' is printed before the plate edge cuts the stub, suffix unknown. Derby Avenue: the name is printed west of the strip; the diagonal leg from Mellwood Avenue to Mitchell Avenue carries only an illegible name ending in 'AVE.' and continues Derby's house numbering, so it is taken as Derby Avenue. The north-south street at x about 1160 is lettered CIRCLE AVE. north of South Circle Avenue and DARROW AVE. south of it (name change at 1161,2225). Mellwood Avenue is one street: east-west at y 2811, diagonal, then north to Derby Avenue. Mitchell Avenue north leg (through the Cincinnati Traction Co. works) and its south-east leg (name printed at about 3500,4300) meet Spring Grove Avenue offset from each other; Donnell Avenue (label reads DONNELL, no prefix seen) meets Spring Grove at the same mouth as the south-east leg. Unnamed 50 ft street running west from Platt Avenue at y 4482 recorded as '?'. Factory lanes in the traction works, the 15 ft strip at x 2145 and the race track are not streets."
